ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, New Madrid County has 75 years on record since 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 39% of normal on the middle, while April to May hit 173%. So far in 2026 the middle shows January to February at 18% and February to March at 37%. Grid 19963 has a preliminary estimate of 37.5 for August to September 2026.</p>"}
